title: Daily xkcd
lang: en
year: 2026
summary: An iPhone and iPad app with a new xkcd strip every day, on the Home Screen and the Lock Screen.
link: https://github.com/Magniswerfer/daily-xkcd
featured: true
translationKey: daily-xkcd
---
xkcd posts on Mondays, Wednesdays and Fridays. Daily xkcd shows each new strip on its day, and on the days in between it picks a classic from the archive, so there's something new every morning.

The widgets come in every size for the Home Screen and the Lock Screen, and they always show the same comic as the app. In the app you get the alt text, a full-screen view with zoom, a list of earlier days and a link to explainxkcd for when you need it.

Built with SwiftUI and WidgetKit. Comics are cached, so it works offline for strips you've already seen.
